<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#101318">
<title>GUÍA DE TV ⚽</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
:root{--blue:#20c5f5;--bg:#101318;--panel:#20252e;--border:#343b47;--text:#f4f6fb;--muted:#aab3c2}
body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--text);background:var(--bg);min-height:100vh}
button,input,select{font:inherit}
.navbar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:12px 18px;background:#20242b;border-bottom:1px solid #353b46;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50}
.nav-tv,.nav-guide{border:0;cursor:pointer;color:white;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;font-weight:bold}
.nav-tv{width:98px;height:76px;border-radius:19px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#18d3d8,#329bff);box-shadow:0 5px 20px #08baff25}
.nav-tv svg{width:34px;height:34px}
.nav-guide{padding:14px 10px;background:transparent;border-radius:12px;font-size:22px}
.nav-guide svg{width:25px;height:25px}
.nav-guide.active{color:var(--blue);background:#ffffff0b}
button:focus-visible,.channel:focus-visible{outline:2px solid white;outline-offset:3px}
.page{display:none}.page.active{display:block}
.container{max-width:1250px;margin:auto;padding:28px 18px}
.section-heading{font-size:25px;margin:10px 0 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.section-heading:before{content:"";width:6px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--blue)}
.panel{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:25px}
.panel-heading{padding:23px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.panel-heading h2{font-size:25px;margin-bottom:9px}
.panel-heading p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}
.search-row{display:flex;gap:12px;padding:16px}
.search-row input,.search-row select{min-width:0;padding:15px;color:white;background:#111419;border:1px solid #414957;border-radius:13px;outline:none}
.search-row input{flex:1}.search-row select{width:220px}
.search-row input:focus,.search-row select:focus{border-color:var(--blue)}
.search-row option{background:#20252e}
.channels{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(155px,1fr));gap:14px}
.channel{--accent:#20c5f5;min-width:0;min-height:158px;padding:16px 10px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:10px;text-align:center;color:white;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#252c37,#171b23);border:1px solid #414957;border-radius:16px;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .18s,border-color .18s}
.channel:before{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;background:var(--accent)}
.channel:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:var(--accent)}
.logo-box{width:100%;height:59px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.logo-box img{max-width:90%;max-height:55px;object-fit:contain}
.logo-fallback{font-size:25px;font-weight:900;font-style:italic;color:var(--accent);overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.channel h3{font-size:14px;line-height:1.35}.channel p{font-size:12px;color:var(--accent)}
.empty{display:none;color:var(--muted);padding:25px 5px;text-align:center}
.feature{margin-top:28px;padding:25px;border:1px solid #31485c;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#17344b,#22243a);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px}
.feature p{color:#c4d3e4;margin-top:9px;line-height:1.5}.feature .ball{font-size:48px}
.agenda-title{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.agenda-title h2{font-size:22px}
.agenda-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:11px 15px;background:#ed2447;color:white;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold}
.agenda-frame{width:100%;height:590px;display:block;border:0;background:#111419}
.agenda-note{padding:14px 18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
#screen{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:100;overflow-y:auto;background:#101318}
.content{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:22px 17px}
.back{border:1px solid #414957;color:white;background:#252c37;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;margin-bottom:20px}
.confirm{max-width:580px;margin:35px auto;text-align:center;padding:32px 22px;border:1px solid #3b4656;border-radius:22px;background:#20252e}
.selected-logo{height:85px;width:100%;object-fit:contain;margin-bottom:22px}
.confirm h1{font-size:clamp(25px,5vw,36px);margin-bottom:15px}
.confirm h1 span{color:var(--blue)}
.confirm p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:24px}
.watch{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ff174f,#ff563d);color:white;border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:15px 27px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}
#player{display:none}#player h1{margin:5px 0 15px}
.videoBox{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#000;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #414957}
iframe.video-frame{width:100%;height:100%;border:0;background:#000}
.player-label{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:13px}
@media(max-width:550px){
.navbar{padding:10px 12px}.nav-tv{width:76px;height:64px}.nav-guide{font-size:19px}
.container{padding:22px 12px}.channels{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}
.channel{min-height:145px;padding:13px 7px}.channel h3{font-size:13px}
.search-row{flex-direction:column}.search-row select{width:100%}
.agenda-frame{height:520px}.panel-heading h2{font-size:21px}.feature{padding:18px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="navbar" aria-label="Navegación principal">
<button class="nav-tv" type="button" onclick="showPage('tv')" aria-label="Televisión" title="Televisión">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M8 2l4 4 4-4M8 12h8"/></svg>
</button>
<button class="nav-guide" id="guideButton" type="button" onclick="showPage('guide')" aria-label="Guía">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><rect x="2" y="2" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="2" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5"/><rect x="2" y="14" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5"/></svg><span>Guía</span>
</button>
</nav>

<main id="tvPage" class="page active">
<div class="container">
<h1 class="section-heading">Canales de televisión</h1>
<section class="panel">
<div class="panel-heading"><h2>📺 Todos los canales</h2><p>Seleccioná un canal para abrir su reproductor.</p></div>
<div class="search-row">
<input id="tvSearch" type="search" placeholder="Buscar canal..." aria-label="Buscar canal">
<select id="tvCategory" aria-label="Categoría"><option value="all">Todos los canales</option><option value="sports">Deportes</option><option value="general">Entretenimiento y TV</option></select>
</div>
</section>
<div class="channels" id="tvChannels"></div><p class="empty" id="tvEmpty">No se encontraron canales.</p>
<div class="feature"><div><h2>⚽ Tu pasión, en un solo lugar</h2><p>Explorá los canales y encontrá tu próxima transmisión favorita.</p></div><div class="ball">🏟️</div></div>
</div>
</main>

<main id="guidePage" class="page">
<div class="container">
<h1 class="section-heading">Guía de televisión</h1>
<section class="panel">
<div class="agenda-title"><h2>🗓️ Agenda Deportiva</h2><a class="agenda-link" href="https://futbollibrefullhd.org/agenda" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Abrir agenda ↗</a></div>
<iframe id="agendaFrame" class="agenda-frame" title="Agenda deportiva" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" src="https://futbollibrefullhd.org/agenda"></iframe>
<p class="agenda-note">Si la agenda no aparece, usá «Abrir agenda». Algunos sitios bloquean su visualización integrada.</p>
</section>
<h2 class="section-heading">📺 Guía para canales</h2>
<section class="panel">
<div class="panel-heading"><h2>Todos los canales</h2><p>Buscá un canal o seleccioná una categoría.</p></div>
<div class="search-row">
<input id="guideSearch" type="search" placeholder="Buscar canal..." aria-label="Buscar canal en la guía">
<select id="guideCategory" aria-label="Categoría de la guía"><option value="all">Todos los canales</option><option value="sports">Deportes</option><option value="general">Entretenimiento y TV</option></select>
</div>
</section>
<div class="channels" id="guideChannels"></div><p class="empty" id="guideEmpty">No se encontraron canales.</p>
</div>
</main>

<div id="screen">
<div class="content">
<button class="back" type="button" onclick="goBack()">← Volver</button>
<section id="confirmation" class="confirm">
<img id="selectedLogo" class="selected-logo" alt="">
<h1>Estás por ver <span id="channelName"></span></h1>
<p>¿Querés comenzar a reproducir este canal?</p>
<button class="watch" type="button" onclick="startChannel()">▶ VER CANAL</button>
</section>
<section id="player">
<h1 id="playerTitle"></h1><p class="player-label">📺 Reproductor de transmisión</p>
<div class="videoBox"><iframe id="frame" class="video-frame" title="Reproductor de video" allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe></div>
</section>
</div>
</div>

